<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50962" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīnārĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		vinum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to wine</i>, <i>wine-.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lacus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 25</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 12, 18, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 27, § 62</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vasculum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Trin. 4, 2, 46</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Mil. 3, 2, 42</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 14,
				13, 14</span></i>. § 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">89: uter,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					28, 18, 73, § 240</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saccus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 24,
					1, 1, § 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crimen,</span>”
				<i>relating to the duties on wine</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Font. 9, 19</span></i>
			: minister, <i>a cup - bearer</i>, Hier. Chron.
			Euseb. ad ann. MDLXX. ab Abrah.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Substt.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīnārĭus</span></b> ,
			ii, m., <i>a
			wine-dealer</i>, <i>vintner</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. As.
				2, 4, 30</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet. Claud. 40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sall. H. Fragm. 1,
			46</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A wine-bibber</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 21, 1,
				4</span></i>, §§ 2 and
			25.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīnārĭum</span></b> ,
			ii, n., <i>a wine-pot</i>,
				<i>wine-flask</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut.
				Trin. 4, 2, 46</span></i> (Ritschl; cf. Brix ad loc.); <i><span class="en">id. Poen.
				4, 2, 16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. S. 2, 8, 39</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Petr. 78</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
